OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to locate family of WW1
OL,4,Ahero's medal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman is appealing for help to find
OL,7,Fthe family of a World War One soldier
OL,8,Fafter discovering his medal in her late
OL,9,Fhusband's collection.
OL,11,FJoyce Smith said the medal was assigned
OL,12,Fto Private Joseph Newbury, from The
OL,13,FSherwood Foresters (Nottinghamshire and
OL,14,FDerbyshire Regiment).
OL,16,FAfter further research, she learned Pte
OL,17,FNewbury was born in Derby and died near
OL,18,FYpres in Belgium in September 1915.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
