OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to locate family of WW1
OL,4,Ahero's medal
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Smith, from Bolton
OL,7,Fin Greater Manchester, said: "All I
OL,8,Fwant is to return this medal to whoever
OL,9,Fshould have it, it's not mine."
